on-demand compaction. You don't have to wait for the window to fill. You can trigger a compaction

47
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:58,000
yourself at a natural break. Four small levers, and together they let you tune how sessions

48
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:05,000
live and die. When you do start fresh, the session isn't really blank, because config re-grounds it

49
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:11,000
for you. Three sources do the work. Your Claude.md loads automatically and restores your durable

50
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:17,000
instructions the moment the session starts, so your rules are back immediately. Auto-memory loads

