And your settings.json reapplies your permissions, hooks, and environment, so the harness behaves

54
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:41,000
exactly the way it did before. Put those together and a fresh session inherits everything that's

55
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:47,000
durable, while leaving the disposable conversation behind. That's the whole point of keeping durable

56
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:53,000
state in config. Let's close the loop with the habit that ties this all together, the clean

